     Finger                        utilities                         Finger     NNAAMMEE               Finger - Report gecos info on user      SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS               Finger <userid>     DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN                       Finger reports  the  information  in the gecos field of a          specified  user's  password entry.  This information includes the          user's  full  name,  telephone  number and such.  It also reports          the user's home directory and login shell.                    If the  user  places  a  file  named .project in his home          directory,  the  first  line of this file will be reported in the          Project:  field  of the finger information. Likewise, if the user          places  a  file  name  .plan  in  his  home directory, the entire          contents  of  this  file  will be displayed as the Plan: field of          the finger report.       CCAAVVEEAATTSS               The  .plan  and  .project files must be made publicly readable if          they are to be useful to anybody but the user.       FFIILLEESS               $HOME/.project          - The project file          $HOME/.plan             - The plan file          /dd/sys/password        - contains gecos info for users     EENNVVIIRROOMMEENNTT               $HOME   - defines the user's home directory     EEXXAAMMPPLLEESS                finger root          Userid: root                           In real life: System Operator          Affiliation: OS9 Gurus                       Office: 555-5978          Exec dir: /h0/CMDS                             Home: (800) OS9-COOL          Directory: /h0                                Shell: /dd/cmds/sh           Project: OS9 software construction          No plan.     SSEEEE AALLSSOO              Password     Page 1                                  Printed (19 Jan 1993 20:17:40)